  "question": "Where can I find a nature reserve bounded by 90 kilometers distance toward the west of Cal, Sr.'s Yard, Aberdeen, MD?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.186327 39.533089)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.186327 39.533089)',4326)::geography, 90000)\nAND leisure = 'nature_reserve'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 247.5 AND 292.5;\n",
